window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They thought they were finally safe.</p> <p>Now, they’ve awakened on Nathasia—a world drenched in blood, scarred by war, and teeming with nightmares.</p> <p>Once home to billions, Nathasia is a ruined graveyard: its seas poisoned by engineered toxins, its surface crawling with Thraxon breeding pits, its skies sealed by a relentless Marck fleet. Kerriah and her companions wake with fractured memories—and the young Tolagon is missing.</p> <p>But even in this hellscape, hope remains:</p> <p>The long-lost Yellow Orb, hidden for decades behind Nathasia’s deadliest horrors, is finally within reach.</p> <p>Across the system, the ruthless Marck Queen prepares her endgame from within an impenetrable fortress. Her command is clear: exterminate all life in the Oro system.</p> <p>To stop her, Crix must face crushing depths, frozen death, and the unthinkable cost of losing everyone he holds dear. As the Queen shatters her own protocols, chaos spreads like wildfire. The Thraxons rise again, uneasy alliances form, and fate begins to move.</p> <p>The darkness is awakening—and the survival of the system will demand the ultimate price from its heroes.</p> <p>Learn more about the different species and locations in this story!</p> <p>gregorybensonbooks.com/databank</p>"; 
